---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Relocation Budget Guide — Relocation Cost">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Guide</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">How to build a relocation budget</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">A useful relocation budget separates the move itself from the costs of getting established at your destination.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Create four buckets</h2>
    <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700"><li>Transport and moving services</li><li>Travel and temporary accommodation</li><li>Deposits, setup, and essential purchases</li><li>Contingency for unexpected costs</li></ol>
    <p class="mt-8 leading-7 text-slate-700">Start with conservative estimates and update each line as you receive actual prices. The goal is a decision-ready budget, not false precision.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
